{"sha": "49d7fac691e147c958e3d69ce0d1ee60a3ad21639a0031bf31f10315a1a89db0", "body": ["\\chapter{三角函数}\\label{ch:g12:trigo}", "", "函数 $\\cos$ 与 $\\sin$ 把圆的几何", "转化为分析问题。它们通过将实数轴绕在单位圆上而定义，", "是周期函数的典型，其导数使它们", "成为振动方程 $y'' = -y$ 的解。", "", "\\section{单位圆}", "", "\\begin{definition}[余弦与正弦]\\label{def:g12:trigo:cossin}", "设 $\\mathcal{C}$ 为标准正交坐标系中以原点为圆心、", "半径为 1 的圆。对每个实数 $t$，取点 $M(t)$，", "取长为 $\\abs{t}$ 的弧，将其绕在 $\\mathcal{C}$ 上，", "起点为 $I(1,0)$，当 $t \\geq 0$ 时按逆时针方向，否则按顺时针方向。则", "\\emph{$\\cos t$ 与 $\\sin t$ 是点", "$M(t)$ 的坐标}\\index{余弦}\\index{正弦}：", "\\[", "M(t) = (\\cos t, \\sin t).", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=2.2]", "  \\draw[->] (-1.25,0) -- (1.35,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.25) -- (0,1.35) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\coordinate (O) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (M) at (50:1);", "  \\draw[thick,omDef] (O) -- (M);", "  \\fill (M) circle (0.6pt) node[above right] {$M(t)$};", "  \\fill (1,0) circle (0.6pt) node[below right] {$I$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (M) -- (M |- O) node[below,pos=1.05] {$\\cos t$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (M) -- (M -| O) node[left,pos=1.02] {$\\sin t$};", "  \\draw[->,omThm,thick] (0.35,0) arc (0:50:0.35);", "  \\node[omThm] at (25:0.5) {$t$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "由于圆的周长为 $2\\pi$，点 $M(t)$", "在 $t$ 增加 $2\\pi$ 时保持不变；又因 $M(t)$ 位于单位圆上，有", "", "\\begin{proposition}[基本恒等式]\\label{prop:g12:trigo:identities}", "对所有 $t \\in \\R$ 与 $k \\in \\Z$，有", "\\[", "\\cos^2 t + \\sin^2 t = 1, \\qquad", "\\cos(t + 2k\\pi) = \\cos t, \\qquad", "\\sin(t + 2k\\pi) = \\sin t,", "\\]", "\\[", "\\cos(-t) = \\cos t, \\qquad \\sin(-t) = -\\sin t,", "\\]", "\\[", "\\cos(\\pi - t) = -\\cos t, \\quad \\sin(\\pi - t) = \\sin t, \\quad", "\\cos\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - t\\right) = \\sin t, \\quad", "\\sin\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - t\\right) = \\cos t .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "第一个恒等式即单位圆的方程；其余各式表达圆的对称性：", "$M(-t)$ 是 $M(t)$ 关于", "$x$ 轴的对称点，$M(\\pi - t)$ 关于 $y$ 轴的对称点，$M(\\frac\\pi2 - t)$ 关于", "直线 $y = x$ 的对称点。", "\\end{proof}", "", "需要熟记的数值：", "\\begin{center}", "\\begin{tabular}{c|ccccc}", "$t$ & $0$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$\\\\[6pt]", "\\hline\\rule{0pt}{14pt}%", "$\\cos t$ & $1$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ & $\\dfrac12$ & $0$\\\\[6pt]", "$\\sin t$ & $0$ & $\\dfrac12$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ & $1$", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[加法公式]\\label{prop:g12:trigo:addition}", "对所有 $a, b \\in \\R$，有", "\\begin{align*}", "\\cos(a+b) &= \\cos a \\cos b - \\sin a \\sin b, &", "\\sin(a+b) &= \\sin a \\cos b + \\cos a \\sin b,\\\\", "\\cos(a-b) &= \\cos a \\cos b + \\sin a \\sin b, &", "\\sin(a-b) &= \\sin a \\cos b - \\cos a \\sin b.", "\\end{align*}", "特别地，$\\cos 2a = 2\\cos^2 a - 1 = 1 - 2\\sin^2 a$ 且", "$\\sin 2a = 2 \\sin a \\cos a$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "向量 $\\vect{u} = (\\cos a, \\sin a)$ 与 $\\vect{v} = (\\cos b, \\sin b)$ 为单位向量，", "它们的夹角为 $a - b$；其数量积一方面等于", "$\\cos a\\cos b + \\sin a \\sin b$（用坐标计算），另一方面等于", "$\\norm{\\vect u}\\,\\norm{\\vect v}\\cos(a-b) = \\cos(a - b)$（用几何方法计算），这就是第三个公式。", "将 $b$ 换为 $-b$ 即得第一个公式；正弦公式", "利用 $\\sin x = \\cos(\\frac\\pi2 - x)$ 推出。倍角公式是取", "$b = a$ 并结合 $\\cos^2 + \\sin^2 = 1$ 所得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{分析研究}", "", "\\begin{lemma}[基本极限]\\label{lem:g12:trigo:sinxx}", "\\[", "\\lim_{t \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin t}{t} = 1", "\\qquad\\text{且}\\qquad", "\\lim_{t \\to 0} \\frac{\\cos t - 1}{t} = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{lemma}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $0 < t < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$，比较单位圆中的三块面积：", "三角形 $OIM(t)$、扇形 $OIM(t)$，以及", "底边为 $OI$、高为 $\\tan t$ 的直角三角形：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\sin t}{2} \\leq \\frac{t}{2} \\leq \\frac{\\tan t}{2}.", "\\]", ""]}